WEBVTT

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:03.100
Oh, evo ga!

00:01:10.591 --> 00:01:11.980
(glazba naglo stane)

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:13.155
Oh!

00:01:13.179 --> 00:01:14.345
(Smijeh)

00:01:14.369 --> 00:01:15.316
Zar ne?

00:01:15.316 --> 00:01:16.742
Kolektivni coitus interruptus.

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:17.783
Ok, možete sjesti.

00:01:17.783 --> 00:01:20.357
(Smijeh)

00:01:20.381 --> 00:01:23.540
Imamo temeljnu potrebu za svršetkom.

00:01:23.564 --> 00:01:25.508
(Smijehom)

00:01:25.532 --> 00:01:27.341
Volimo svršenost.

00:01:27.365 --> 00:01:29.903
(Pljesak)

00:01:29.927 --> 00:01:33.177
Čuo sam da bi Mozart prije spavanja,